        <h1>Programs shaped for sustainable momentum</h1>
        <p style="color:var(--muted);margin:6px 0 0">Curated sequences that combine practice, accountability, and simple checkpoints. Each program emphasizes actionable habits and a clear measurement to track progress.</p>
      </div>
